                        1900 --729:  * \param       [in] mode               Operation mode.
                        1901 --730:  * \param       [in] sync_option        Indicate if the function returns while PKCC is running. <br>
                        1902 --731:  *                                          Following value can be selected.
                        1903 --732:  *                                            - PKC_SYNC_OPT_SYNC  : Don't return while PKCC is running
                        1904 --733:  *                                            - PKC_SYNC_OPT_ASYNC : Returns while PKCC is running
                        1905 --734:  * \return
                        1906 --735:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                  Successfully done.
                        1907 --736:  *  - #PKCD_RET_INTERNALERR:         Internal processing failed.
                        1908 --737:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCTIMEOUTERR:      PKCC operation timeouted.
                        1909 --738:  *  - #PKCD_RET_PKCCERR:             An error occurred while the PKCC operations.
                        1910 --739:  * \par Security components
                        1911 --740:  *  - No
                        1912 --741:  * \par Global Variables
