                        1916 --745:  *    #PKCD_CMN_ICUM_PKCCB0STR
                        1917 --746:  * \par Precondition
                        1918 --747:  *  - PKCC arithmetic data must be configured beforehand.
                        1919 --748:  * \par Detailed description
